oyalty":"98","reputation":"31150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014605","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1035","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[61,26,74,78,89,59],"title":-1,"rank":"2","loyalty":"98","reputation":"31150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014605","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[61,26,74,78,89,59],"title":-1,"rank":"2","loyalty":"98","reputation":"31150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014605","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1027","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[61,26,74,78,89,59],"title":-1,"rank":"2","loyalty":"98","reputation":"31150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014605","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[61,26,74,78,89,59],"title":-1,"rank":"2","loyalty":"98","reputation":"31150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014605","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[61,26,74,78,89,59],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014605","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10160","city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":1,"stats":[61,26,74,78,89,59],"title":25,"rank":"3","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1014605","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1035702","name":{"zh":"川蜀风云","en":"Winds of Change in Shu"},"year":"214","month":"1","desc":{"zh":"荆州已平定大半，刘备继续采用诸葛亮的建议，向益州靠拢。\n\n触发条件：刘备、关羽、张飞、赵云、诸葛亮、刘璋、张鲁、马超存活。 江夏、江陵属刘备，成都、梓潼、巴郡属刘璋，马超属张鲁。\n\n亲历条件：【身属刘备、刘璋或张鲁势力】\n\n逆天改命：【<刘备势力><非前半部分留守后方的武将>救下庞统，<与张任关系等级至少为2>使张任存活并使其成为家将】","en":"With most of Jing Province pacified, Liu Bei continues to follow Zhuge Liang's counsel, turning his ambitions toward Yi Province.\n\n\n\nTrigger Condition: Liu Bei, Guan Yu, Zhang Fei, Zhao Yun, Zhuge Liang, Liu Zhang, Zhang Lu, and Ma Chao are alive. Jiangxia and Jiangling belong to Liu Bei, Chengdu, Zitong, and Ba Commandery belong to Liu Zhang, Ma Chao belongs to Zhang Lu.\n\n\n\nParticipation Condition: 【Belong to the Faction of Liu Bei, Liu Zhang, or Zhang Lu】\n\n\n\nDefy Fate: 【<Liu Bei's Faction><Officer not stationed in the Rear during the first half> Rescue Pang Tong, <Relationship level with Zhang Ren is at least Level 2> Ensure Zhang Ren survives and recruit him as a Retainer】"}}],"biography":{"zh":"东汉末年汉宁太守。其祖父张道陵创立五斗米道，父亲张衡继承衣钵，至张鲁时将宗教势力与政治统治深度融合。曹操与马超对峙期间，欲强取刘璋所屯守的属地。刘备进攻蜀地之时，派遣来投靠不久的马超继续对抗曹操。被曹操击败后，逃往巴西，不久后被曹操招降，曹操因其封存府库、保全百姓的行为，封其为镇南将军、阆中侯，食邑万户，并将女儿嫁与曹操之子曹宇。","tc":"東漢末年漢寧太守。其祖父張道陵創立五斗米道，父親張衡繼承衣缽，至張魯時將宗教勢力與政治統治深度融合。曹操與馬超對峙期間，欲強取劉璋所屯守的屬地。劉備進攻蜀地之時，派遣來投靠不久的馬超繼續對抗曹操。被曹操擊敗后，逃往巴西，不久后被曹操招降，曹操因其封存府庫、保全百姓的行為，封其為鎮南將軍、閬中侯，食邑萬戶，并將女兒嫁與曹操之子曹宇。","en":"Governor of Hanning in the late Eastern Han. His grandfather Zhang Daoling founded the Way of the Five Pecks of Rice, and his father Zhang Heng continued the tradition. By Zhang Lu's time, religious authority and political rule were deeply intertwined. During Cao Cao's standoff with Ma Chao, Zhang Lu sought to seize Liu Zhang's territory. When Liu Bei invaded Shu, he sent the recently-defected Ma Chao to continue opposing Cao Cao. After Cao Cao defeated him, Zhang Lu fled to Baxi and soon surrendered. Cao Cao, impressed that Zhang Lu had sealed the treasury and protected the populace, appointed him South Off. (subjugation), Marquis of Langzhong, with a fief of ten thousand households, and gave one of his daughters in marriage to Cao Cao's son Cao Yu.","jp":"後漢末期の漢寧太守。祖父の張道陵が五斗米道を創始し、父の張衡が衣鉢を継ぎ、張魯の代に至って宗教勢力と政治統治を深く融合させた。曹操と馬超が対峙していた間、曹操は劉璋が屯守する属地を強奪しようとした。劉備が蜀地を進攻した際には、投靠して間もない馬超を派遣して引き続き曹操に対抗させた。曹操に敗れた後は巴西へと逃れたが、まもなく曹操に招かれて降った。曹操は彼が府庫を封印して民を保全した行いを評価し、鎮南将軍・閬中侯に封じて食邑万戸を与え、その娘を曹操の子である曹宇に嫁がせた。","kr":"동한 말년의 한녕태수. 조부 장도릉이 오두미도를 창시하고 부친 장형이 그 뒤를 이었으며, 장로 대에 이르러 종교 세력과 정치적 통치를 깊이 융합시켰다. 조조와 마초가 대치하는 틈을 타 유장이 주둔해 지키던 영지를 무력으로 차지하려 했다. 유비가 촉을 공격했을 때는 귀순한 지 얼마 되지 않은 마초를 파견해 계속해서 조조에게 맞서게 했다. 조조에게 패한 뒤 파서로 달아났으나 얼마 지나지 않아 조조에게 항복했는데, 조조는 그가 부고를 봉인하고 백성을 보전한 처사를 높이 여겨 진남장군·낭중후에 봉하고 식읍 1만 호를 내렸으며, 딸을 조조의 아들인 조우에게 출가시켰다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10160","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"鲁","nameTc":"魯","nameEn":"Lu","nameJp":"魯","nameKr":"노","nameOther":"","word":"公祺","wordTc":"公祺","wordEn":"Gongqi","wordJp":"公祺","wordKr":"공기","wordOther":"","icon":"张鲁","power":"WJ10160","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1036","gender":"0","rule":"61","force":"26","wise":"74","politics":"78","charm":"89","will":"59","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"10","charmTalent":"13","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"6/6/6/6/6/72/35/6","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1009302","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1002005;S1002305",